Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:16:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: i2c: ak7375: Add AK7374
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The AK7374 is the voice coil driver of the Sony IMX582 main camera
module in the Sony Xperia 10 VI. It is controlled like the AK7375, over
the same registers, with a 10-bit position.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/asahi-kasei,ak7375.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/asahi-kasei,ak7375.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/asahi-kasei,ak7375.yaml
index fe312cc6a..8cf24c858 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/asahi-kasei,ak7375.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/asahi-kasei,ak7375.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - asahi-kasei,ak7345
+      - asahi-kasei,ak7374
       - asahi-kasei,ak7375
 
   reg:
